flowchart TD

    User[Web Application]
    APIGW[API Gateway]

    subgraph Write Path Critical under 100ms
        CmdSvc[Pricing Management Service]
        Cache[In-Memory Cache]
        Outbox[Outbox Table]
    end

    subgraph Event Backbone
        EventBus[Event Bus]
    end

    subgraph Read Path High Scale
        ProjSvc[Pricing Projection Service]
        QueryDB[Read Model DB]
        CacheLayer[Distributed Cache]
    end

    subgraph Supporting Services
        RateSvc[Rate Service]
        HotelSvc[Hotel Management Service]
        IdentitySvc[User Identity Service]
        DistSvc[Distribution Service]
    end

    ExternalCMS[Property Management System]
    ExternalPMS[Channel Management System]

    %% User flow
    User --> APIGW
    APIGW --> CmdSvc
    APIGW --> ProjSvc

    %% Security
    APIGW --> IdentitySvc

    %% Write path optimization
    CmdSvc --> Cache
    Cache --> RateSvc
    Cache --> HotelSvc

    %% Event publishing
    CmdSvc --> Outbox
    Outbox --> EventBus

    %% Event consumption
    EventBus --> ProjSvc
    EventBus --> DistSvc

    %% Read path
    ProjSvc --> QueryDB
    QueryDB --> CacheLayer
    CacheLayer --> APIGW

    %% External integration
    DistSvc --> External